1
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:06,020
欢迎来到威廉斯堡餐厅颁奖典礼
Welcome to the Williamsburg Diner Awards Night!

2
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:09,120
这位是主持人 尼尔·帕特里克·哈哈哈
And here's your host, Neil Patrick Hairless!

3
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:13,420
今夜是大家这一年来
This is the night where everyone is recognized

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,720
所谓的"努力工作" 受到认可的夜晚
for their, well... let's call it work.

5
00:00:16,462 --> 00:00:17,631
阿憨 西装挺好看
Nice suit, Han.

6
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,860
我好爱你在《马达加斯加的企鹅》里的演出
I loved you in The Penguins of Madagascar.

7
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:23,360
颁奖开始 首先
Here we go. The award for

8
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:26,680
最佳迟到烂理由奖得主是...
Worst Excuse for Being Late to Work goes to...

9
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,840
厄尔 作品是"我死了"
Earl, for: "I died."

10
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,620
这是真的
It was true.

11
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:34,540
我有足足六十秒算是真死了
I was dead for a full 60 seconds.

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:38,480
而最佳外语片得主是...
And the Foreign Film Award goes to...

13
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:41,180
奥列格 因为你总是满身外来细菌
Oleg, for always being covered in a foreign film.

14
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:45,080
是的 我想感谢好多助我得奖的外来细菌
Yeah. I have so many bacteria to thank...

15
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,880
但我要特别感谢链球菌
but a special shout-out to streptococcus!

16
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:53,500
而最佳骗小费骗子奖的得主是...
And the winner for Best Lie Told to Get a Bigger Tip goes to...

17
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,340
闺蜜 祝你好运
Good luck, girl.

18
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,820
跟你一起提名竞争这个奖真得很荣幸
It's an honor to share this category with you.

19
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,720
是麦克斯
It's Max...

20
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:01,080
得奖原因是常让客人看
for showing customers pictures

21
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,680
自己三个嗷嗷待哺小孩的照片
of her three small children on a regular basis.

22
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:08,640
这个奖我想献给我生命中的光
This award is dedicated to the lights of my life--

23
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:10,663
麦克欣 麦克斯二世
Maxine, Max Jr.,

24
00:01:10,663 --> 00:01:12,800
与麦克"魏生津"
and Maxi-Pad.

25
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,780
我知道你们三个里只有一个能看与听到我
I know only one of you can see and hear me,

26
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:18,320
所以帮我跟另外两个说
so please tell the others

27
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:20,560
我 爱 你
I...love...you.

28
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:26,500
而最佳女服务员奖得奖人是
And the award for Best Waitress goes to...

29
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,500
可别是我
It better not!

30
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:28,354
卡洛琳
Caroline!

31
00:01:28,354 --> 00:01:31,320
不要
No!

32
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:33,860
看来这是真的 女人只有
Well, I guess it's true-- women only win awards

33
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:36,080
演出丢人角色才会得奖
when they take on roles that are humiliating.

34
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:40,520
最佳动画"短"片得主是李憨
And the Best Animated Short goes to Han Lee!

35
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,040
这是菜单
Here's your menu.

36
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:04,480
我现在去帮你拿杯水
I'll be right back with your water

37
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,320
以及洗胃器
and a stomach pump.

38
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:08,260
不用菜单 我知道我自己要啥
Keep it. I know what I want.

39
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,220
我也知道我自己要啥
Me too. But it just seems like

40
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:12,140
但泰勒·斯威夫特就是死不分手
Taylor Swift is never going away.

41
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:17,120
你很搞笑
You're funny. Yeah.

42
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,800
但是我没心情看你搞笑
I'm not in the mood for funny.

43
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:24,720
我要番茄汤 家常沙拉多加面包丁
I will take tomato soup, house salad, extra croutons.

44
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:26,820
如果你那两颗"馒头"下没有人性
And you can charge me extra...

45
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:28,920
你可以收我额外面包丁的钱
if you have no heart behind those gazongas.

46
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,720
算啦 那边吧台有个男人没牙
It's cool. The guy at the counter has no teeth,

47
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,620
你可以吃他的面包丁
so you can have his.

48
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,780
少点搞笑 多点沙拉可以吗
Less funny--more salad. Right?

49
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,640
让那边的金发妞给我上菜吧
Maybe the blonde one should bring it.

50
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:43,140
你想要那妞帮你上吗
Oh, you want her to bring it?

51
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,400
那先把你之后行程全取消吧
Maybe clear your calendar.

52
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:49,120
坐卡座的女士不喜欢我态度 指名要你
Uh, the lady in the booth doesn't like my attitude and wants you,

53
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,860
我想我真正想说的是
so I guess what I'm saying is

54
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:51,940
我果然还宝刀未老
I still got it!

55
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:56,560
等等 有客人点我 而且没有接着说
Wait, a customer asked for me and didn't follow it with,

56
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,920
"把经理叫过来说话"吗
"I'd also like to see the manager"?

57
00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,620
这可是第一次呀
That's a first for me!

58
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:01,780
喂 金发妹
Yo, blondie!

59
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,860
面包丁
Croutons!

60
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:07,160
上菜 番茄汤 家常沙拉
Pick up. Tomato soup, house salad.

61
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,860
我这里还有D[二号]电池特卖
And I'm also running a special on D batteries.

62
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,720
如果都买了 我再送一份
Buy both, and I'll thrown in this bootleg copy

63
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,880
电影《坏老板2》盗版光盘
of Horrible Bosses II.

64
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,620
坏老板2矮子来了
Here comes Horrible Bosses Too Small.

65
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,080
需要来点电池好能持续走路与说话吗
Need some new batteries to keep walking and talking?

66
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:29,180
不 我不像你 动力来自双D电池[胸]
No, Max, I'm not powered by double Ds like you.

67
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,040
同意
Preach.

68
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:41,000
别跟这货买电池
Don't buy batteries from that guy

69
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,500
除非你想心脏[起搏器]突然在公车上没电
unless you want your heart to stop on the bus.

70
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,580
奥列格 这份要多加面包丁
Oleg, this is supposed to have extra croutons.

71
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,780
这是我常客要的
It's for my regular.

72
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:51,720
是的 你没听错 我也有常客
Yeah, you heard me. It happened.

73
00:03:53,180 --> 00:03:55,440
靠 加面包丁姐又来了吗
Oh, no, "extra croutons" is here again?

74
00:03:55,500 --> 00:03:57,080
记得多收她钱
Make sure you charge her extra.

75
00:03:57,160 --> 00:03:58,620
我又不是面包做的
I'm not made of stale bread!

76
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,840
当然不是 你是乐高积木做的 对吧
No, you're made of Legos, right?

77
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:03,580
我们不可以多收她钱
We are not charging her extra.

78
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,120
感觉她应该付不起
She looks like she can't afford it.

79
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:07,000
她要是付得起钱 她也不用来这吃了
If she could, why would she be eating here?

80
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:09,360
不要以貌取人
Well, don't judge a book by its cover.

81
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:10,400
像别人看到我 会觉得...
People look at me and--

82
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,200
觉得你床上一条虫吗
Think you're bad in bed?

83
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:11,760
你到底想说啥
What's your point?

84
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:16,060
我告诉你 我可不是床上一条虫
For your information, Max, I'm not bad in bed.

85
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:19,040
我在《模拟人生》界里 可是床上一条龙
In fact, I'm quite the stud in my Sims community.

86
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:23,220
你连在退休人士界里都只能算小蚯蚓
You wouldn't be a stud in a retirement community.

87
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,520
这是你的沙拉
Hi! Here's your salad...

88
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:31,376
五 六 七 八 九 十
Uh...five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

89
00:04:31,376 --> 00:04:33,380
你继续说
Uh, continue.

90
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:35,140
我想跟你自我介绍一下
And I wanted to introduce myself.

91
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,800
我叫卡洛琳 是你的常驻服务员
I'm Caroline, you're regular waitress.

92
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:40,340
轮到我介绍啦 抱歉
Oh! My turn. Sorry.

93
00:04:40,820 --> 00:04:43,540
我独居 我的植物都没你粘人
I live alone, and my plants aren't this needy.

94
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:44,100
我叫诺拉
I'm Nola.

95
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:47,480
这位是麦克斯 麦克斯 这是诺拉
And this is Max. Max, this is Nola.

96
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:48,340
哟 萝拉
'Sup, Lola?

97
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:49,900
是诺拉
It's Nola.

98
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:53,100
你看 这就是为啥我喜欢金发妹
See, this is why I like the blonde one.

99
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:53,820
她会用心听
She listens.

100
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:56,960
我能点个芝士蛋糕吗
May I please have a cheesecake?

101
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,020
没问题 也谢谢你 诺拉
Sure. And thank you, Nola.

102
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:00,800
我也觉得用心听别人说话很重要
I think it's important to listen to people.

103
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,780
樱桃派马上就到
Coming right back with that cherry pie.

104
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:08,100
她要是哪天不听人说话了我会跟她说
I'll tell her if she ever stops listening.

105
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:12,200
我觉得诺拉知道我不只是个服务生
I think Nola knows I'm more than just a waitress.

106
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:13,980
她能看穿这制服下的我
She can see right through this uniform.

107
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,800
我也能"看穿" 只要灯光对了就行
And so can I... in just the right light.

108
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,880
-关门 -我的天啊
- Close the door! - Oh, my God!

109
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,280
苏菲 我要被你吓死
Sophie, you scared me!

110
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,440
你还知道怕吗
You're scared?

111
00:05:23,980 --> 00:05:26,340
我刚刚看到这牛奶的过期日才怕
I just saw the expiration date on this milk!

112
00:05:28,180 --> 00:05:29,040
快点关上 快
Come on, close it, quick!

113
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,900
我在这里面躲奥列格呢
I'm in here hiding from Oleg.

114
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,780
如果你想避开奥列格
If you wanna get away from Oleg,

115
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:34,440
只要躲到卖牙线的地方就行了
just go anywhere they sell floss.

116
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:38,580
我觉得奥列格在偷吃
I think that Oleg is cheating on me.

117
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,200
你看
Look.

118
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:39,840
天啊
Oh, God!

119
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:41,400
她现在要大咧咧直接"甩"出来了吗
Now she's gonna start whipping it out?

120
00:05:42,448 --> 00:05:43,480
你看
Look...

121
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,920
他有另一只秘密手机
He has a second secret phone.

122
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,800
是一次"性电话"
It's a boner phone.

123
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:50,660
你是说"一次性"电话吧
You mean a burner phone.

124
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:51,560
半斤八两
Same thing.

125
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:53,340
苏菲 你怎么知道
Sophie, how do you know

126
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:55,360
他不是只是拿来打长途电话或...
he just doesn't use it for long distance or...

127
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,500
或是给我正在打过去的女人打电话吗
Or for the woman that I'm calling right now?

128
00:05:58,140 --> 00:05:59,520
快开免提
Oh, put her on speaker.

129
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,220
反正我也没别的事干了 我在上班
I've nothing else to do. I'm at work.

130
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,480
谁 奥列格吗
Da? Oleg?

131
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:13,780
奥列格
Oleg?

132
00:06:19,300 --> 00:06:22,120
你学奥列格也太烂了
That... is a terrible Oleg.

133
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:24,800
他口齿哪有这么清晰
He is not that articulate.

134
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,720
看 这老婊子
Hah! That old whore!

135
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,300
她说啥了
What did she say?

136
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,760
我听不懂
I have no idea!

137
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:39,380
我不会说俄文 不过...
I don't speak Russian, but...

138
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:41,567
但我懂"老婊语"
I do speak "Old whore."

139
00:06:41,567 --> 00:06:45,740
你们说 他脑子到底哪有病
Tell me, what is his problem?

140
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:49,080
他家有我这样甜美可人又青春的佳人
He has a sweet, young filly like me at home

141
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:51,220
结果他还要出去
and he needs to go out

142
00:06:51,220 --> 00:06:53,880
去帮这俄国老婊"松松土"
and plow some old Russian field?

143
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:00,820
我很想问你们三个在这里面干嘛
Well...I'd ask what you three are doing in here,

144
00:07:00,820 --> 00:07:02,500
但任何答案
but it's never gonna top

145
00:07:02,500 --> 00:07:04,120
都不会比我脑子里想得还给劲
what I'm imagining you're doing in here.

146
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:12,780
真不敢相信诺拉今晚没来
I can't believe Nola didn't come in tonight.

147
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:15,880
这就像我那个星巴克咖啡师一样
This is exactly what happened with my Starbucks barista guy.

148
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:19,133
前一秒 他还摆弄着香蕉来"暗示"我
One minute, he's suggestively arranging the bananas at me,

149
00:07:19,133 --> 00:07:21,200
下一秒 他就倒地扑街
and then next minute, he's face-down,

150
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,860
死在一滩豆奶里
dead in a puddle of soy milk.

151
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:25,540
麦克斯 万一她出事了怎么办
Max, what if something happened to her?

152
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:27,260
那我们就有更多面包丁吃了
More croutons for us!

153
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,040
她有说"我们明天见"
She said, "I'll see you tomorrow."

154
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,980
这话根本没啥含义 只是种说法
That doesn't mean anything. It's just an expression like,

155
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:35,060
就像"员工一定得洗手"
"Employees must wash hands."

156
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:38,980
或像"这孩子是你的"一样
Or... or, "The baby is yours."

157
00:07:40,700 --> 00:07:41,760
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

158
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:46,540
苏菲 只是你而已啊
Oh, Sophie, it's just you.

159
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:48,240
你个死穷鬼
You're poor!

160
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:50,180
现在咱们扯平了
And now we're even.

161
00:07:50,780 --> 00:07:52,140
你们看 我又偷来了 奥列格人呢
Look, I stole it again. Where's Oleg?

162
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,280
我告诉你他不会在哪里
I'll tell you where he's not--

163
00:07:54,420 --> 00:07:55,640
烹饪学校
Culinary school.

164
00:07:56,730 --> 00:07:57,600
他在休息
He's on break.

165
00:07:58,060 --> 00:08:00,040
这老婊要惨了
Oh, she's gonna be sorry!

166
00:08:01,340 --> 00:08:04,360
没人可以插进苏菲跟她男人之间
Oh...no one comes between Sophie and her man.

167
00:08:04,860 --> 00:08:06,820
除非是我们"付钱"请来的
You know...unless we pay them to.

168
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,360
我有几件事
Couple things--

169
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,920
问题一 咱们这里有人工作吗
A--does anyone ever work here?

170
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:18,200
卡洛琳 别瞎操心了 加面包丁姐没事
Caroline, stop worrying. Extra Croutons is fine.

171
00:08:18,420 --> 00:08:21,040
她刚才打电话来叫了餐厅外卖
She just called to order some diner food to be delivered.

172
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:24,080
原来 她是想死在家啊
Oh! So she wants to die at home.

173
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:27,220
我说了我们不做外送
I said we don't do deliveries.

174
00:08:27,220 --> 00:08:29,400
我跟她说你们俩连把食物
I told her you two can barely get the food

175
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,980
从窗口送到桌上都很勉强了
from the window to the tables!

176
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:38,880
麦克斯 我必需得来
Max, I had to stop by

177
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,640
帮诺拉把她的沙拉与面包丁送过来
and bring Nola her salad and croutons.

178
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:43,060
她现在算是我的头号粉丝呢
I mean, she's kind of my biggest fan right now.

179
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:45,060
的确 因为我理解无能[失去了我]
True...'cause you just lost me.

180
00:08:46,860 --> 00:08:48,660
我知道你觉得这很神经病
I know you think this is crazy,

181
00:08:48,660 --> 00:08:50,920
但是诺拉看我的眼神里有些特别之处
but there's something about the way Nola looks at me.

182
00:08:50,940 --> 00:08:52,940
感觉她看到了我身上的一些东西
It's like she's seeing something in me.

183
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:55,200
这女人戴着两副眼镜
The woman wears two pairs of glasses.

184
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:58,100
对她来说 你只是个废话多的黄橘色模糊体
To her, you're just a chatty yellow and orange blur.

185
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,737
人家跟我说你不送货[没让人爽到]呢
I was told you didn't deliver.

186
00:09:01,737 --> 00:09:04,747
谁说的 她的旧爱们吗
By who, her old boy friends?

187
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:08,260
你们俩是来杀我还是干嘛的吗
Are you two gonna kill me or something?

188
00:09:08,600 --> 00:09:09,900
因为如果是
Because if you are,

189
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:12,000
那我想换一顶帽子再死
I would like to put on a different hat.

190
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:15,140
不不不 她是担心你
No, no, no. She got worried.

191
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,880
因为你是她第一个常客
See, you're her first regular.

192
00:09:16,980 --> 00:09:18,400
而我只是来看戏的
I'm just here for the story.

193
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:20,500
我猜想这扇门后可能有些怪玩意
I figured there'd be something freaky behind this door

194
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:23,760
比如15.2米长的蟒蛇与快递小哥的残骸
like a 50-foot python and what's left of the UPS guy.

195
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:25,860
而厄尔是猜你其实是男人
And Earl guessed you were a man.

196
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:27,740
没有男人
No man.

197
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:30,960
只有我与我的"老妹妹"以及我的照片
No, just me in here with my vagina and my photographs.

198
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,460
原来你是个摄影师啊
Oh! You're a photographer?

199
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:34,940
我也喜欢摄影
I love photography!

200
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:36,620
而我喜欢个人隐私
And I love privacy.

201
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,060
而我喜欢大麻
And I love pot.

202
00:09:38,740 --> 00:09:40,160
我还以为在轮着说呢
Oh, I thought we were going around.

203
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:42,960
来吧 你最好也进来
Come on. You better come in too.

204
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,220
一阴一阳 一话多一封嘴
You're the Yin to her Yap.

205
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:46,700
小心地上
Hey, careful where you step.

206
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:49,560
我找不到我第三副眼镜
I can't find my third pair of glasses.

207
00:09:49,940 --> 00:09:50,980
在你的帽子上啊
It's on top of your hat.

208
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:52,260
不 那是我的第四副
No, that's my fourth pair.

209
00:09:54,620 --> 00:09:56,080
这是流浪比利
This is Billy the bum!

210
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:59,060
他以前住在我公寓街角的一个箱子里
He used to live in a box around the corner from my apartment.

211
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,680
他有一次还让我借住他家呢
He even let me stay over once

212
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,420
当时我想远离我那个烂室友一阵
when I had to get away from this bad roommate.

213
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:03,680
我之前那个吗
Oh, the one before me?

214
00:10:03,780 --> 00:10:04,640
不 就是你
No, it was you.

215
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:07,920
你们俩在一起可真够闹腾
You two are a riot together.

216
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:12,040
你们让我想起我与我的摄影师老朋友
You remind me of me and my old photographer friend

217
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:13,260
安妮·莱柏维兹
Annie Leibovitz.

218
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:15,220
当然 这是在她...
Course, this was before...

219
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:16,140
在她成名之前吗
Before she got famous?

220
00:10:16,280 --> 00:10:18,140
不 在她泡我之前
No. Before she hit on me.

221
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:21,380
我告诉她我对女人没兴趣
I told her I wasn't into girls.

222
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:24,720
可能她以为我戴这帽子所以是拉拉吧
But...I think she was confused by the derby.

223
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:27,780
是的 我觉得大家都这么误会了
Yeah. I think we're all a little confused by it.

224
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:31,720
诺拉 我很想问你是否功成名就过
Nola, I want to ask you if you've ever had any success,

225
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,820
但我不知道怎么问你才不会侮辱到你
but I don't know how to do that without insulting you.

226
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,440
没错 你不知道
That's correct. You don't.

227
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:41,939
你在苏活区要办摄影展啊
Oh! You're having a gallery show in SoHo?

228
00:10:41,939 --> 00:10:43,380
慢走不送
Good-bye.

229
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:46,080
谢谢你们俩这么好心
Uh, it was nice of you two

230
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:48,340
过来... 看看我
to, uh, come over, check on me.

231
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:50,180
有点怪 不过很有心
Uh...weird, but nice.

232
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,700
或许我们可以去参加开幕啊
Perhaps we could come to the opening.

233
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,240
不用 你们不用这样
Oh. Oh, you don't need to do that.

234
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:56,420
我知道我们不用这样
I know we don't need to,

235
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,580
但或许我很想支持你以及你的杰出作品啊
but maybe I want to support you and your amazing work.

236
00:10:58,580 --> 00:11:00,060
而麦克斯也会很享受免费酒水
And Max would enjoy. The free wine.

237
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,000
我会的
Yes, I would.

238
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:02,000
不
No.

239
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:03,240
我绝对会
Oh, I would.

240
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,340
不的意思是"不 别来"
No as in, "No, don't come."

241
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,780
抱歉 麻烦你们给点空间
Now, if you'll excuse me,

242
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:10,500
我想吃我的面包丁了
I wanna eat my croutons

243
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:12,920
不用两位滑稽歌舞演员相伴
without the vaudeville stylings

244
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,400
搞笑精与多管闲事精
of Shecky and Nosy.

245
00:11:19,126 --> 00:11:20,800
给
Here.

246
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:23,280
太好了 我正在找这个呢
Oh, yeah, good. I was looking for this.

247
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:34,860
真不敢相信你为了一个餐厅常客这么上心
I can't believe you're doing all this for a diner regular.

248
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,480
好久没见你这么没节操上杆子倒贴了
I haven't seen you this desperate since Monday,

249
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,160
打从这周一二三四和周五之后
Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday.

250
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:42,840
是啊 到周末时我已经放弃了
I know--on the weekends, I just give up.

251
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,020
瞧这主题
Look that title!

252
00:11:45,260 --> 00:11:46,720
"下层社会"[未清洗的大物]
"The Great Unwashed."

253
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:48,880
奥列格的蛋蛋也参展了吗
Are Oleg's balls here?

254
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:54,840
麦克斯 这里是"艺术展"
Max, it's the "Art scene."

255
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,205
有点档次 至少说"睾丸"好吗
Class it up. At least say testicles.

256
00:11:57,205 --> 00:11:59,720
晚上好 女士们
Evening, ladies.

257
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,180
厄尔 你怎么会在这里
Earl, what are you doing here?

258
00:12:01,300 --> 00:12:03,580
阿憨 你的头要被毛衣吃掉了
And, Han, your sweater's eating your head.

259
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:07,260
我是来喝免费香槟的
I'm here for the champagne

260
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:10,560
还因为我找不到出去的路了
and because I couldn't find my way out.

261
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:15,060
我刚撞上了一张门的照片
I just walked into a picture of a door.

262
00:12:17,260 --> 00:12:20,160
这里有的照片要卖到好几千美元
Some of these are going for thousands of dollars!

263
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,340
那个贱人诺拉真有钱 我猜她肯定
That Nola bitch is rich, and I bet she has

264
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:24,940
他妈的有度假屋 全靠蹭我面包丁挣得
a frigging summer house made out of my free croutons!

265
00:12:27,340 --> 00:12:30,480
阿憨 这里是艺术展 要有格调
Han, it's the art scene. Class it up.

266
00:12:30,780 --> 00:12:33,940
好歹也用"他妹的" 还有记得是"睾丸"哟
At least say "Freaking." Also, "Testicles."

267
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,580
我才不要把我的新高领毛衣浪费在你俩身上
Well, I'm not wasting this new turtleneck on you two.

268
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:39,200
我要去猎艳
I'm going to go mingle.

269
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:41,740
刚才一位高街时尚模特对我抛媚眼呢
A high fashion model was giving me the eye.

270
00:12:42,340 --> 00:12:43,640
那她一定是喝"高"了吧
Then she'd have to be high.

271
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:47,720
阿憨 我还是待在这里吧
Uh, Han, I believe I'll stay here.

272
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:51,120
让忍者神龟当泡妞搭档
Nobody wins with a Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtle

273
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,120
想成功都难
as a wingman.

274
00:12:53,719 --> 00:12:55,900
各位好呀
Oh, hey, everybody.

275
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:57,380
苏菲 奥列格
Hey, Sophie. Hey, Oleg.

276
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:59,320
我的档次可以降档了吗
So can I class it back down now?

277
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:03,060
抱歉我们来晚了 我刚在那边
Sorry we're late. I was just over there

278
00:13:03,060 --> 00:13:06,060
欣赏一张拍摄桥下幸福情侣的照片
admiring the photo of the happy couple under the bridge.

279
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:07,460
幸福的情侣
Happy couple?

280
00:13:07,780 --> 00:13:10,260
苏菲 那是两个瘾君子在共用一根针头
Sophie, they're two junkies sharing a needle.

281
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:14,382
是啊 至少那个女瘾君子
Yeah, well, at least the lady junkie

282
00:13:14,382 --> 00:13:16,840
知道自己男人的"针头"碰过哪里
knows where his needle's been.

283
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:18,860
我觉得那女的连那男的名字都不知道
I don't even think she knows her name.

284
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,440
她只是假装不知道罢了
Well, she knows more than she's letting on.

285
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:22,560
其实她洞悉一切
She knows everything.

286
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,280
你们俩已经转过一圈了
Hey, you guys have been here a while.

287
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:28,380
哪里是偷食物的最佳去处
Where's the best place to steal some food?

288
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:29,320
麦克斯
Max!

289
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:30,340
抱歉 失礼了
Sorry, sorry.

290
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:33,000
要有档次地说 "睾"些食物
Classing it up: Testicles some food?

291
00:13:34,740 --> 00:13:37,780
麦克斯 从你无礼的举止我可以看出
Oh, Max, I can tell by your sassy demeanor

292
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:39,879
你肯定还没看见你的照片
you haven't seen your photo yet.

293
00:13:39,879 --> 00:13:43,429
什么照片 我从未用过空头支票在这行骗啊
What photo? I haven't bounced any checks here.

294
00:13:46,240 --> 00:13:48,160
好吧 还真是我
Yep, that's me, all right.

295
00:13:49,020 --> 00:13:51,380
我认出了"老娘懒得鸟"式撅嘴
I recognize that "I don't care" pout

296
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:53,920
以及沾在我头发上的千岛酱
and the Thousand Island dressing in my hair.

297
00:13:55,380 --> 00:13:57,160
麦克斯 你的照片挂在墙上
Max, just because you're hanging on a wall

298
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:59,760
跟这个城市最贫穷最迷惘的灵魂们在一起
among the poorest, most lost souls in our city

299
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:03,040
并不意味着你的人生是...
doesn't mean that your life is...

300
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:05,320
我的照片就挂在我身后 是吗
I'm hanging right behind me, aren't I?

301
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,380
我的老天
Oh, my God!

302
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,180
不是正面全裸照 不幸中之万幸啊
It could be worse. You could be naked.

303
00:14:13,100 --> 00:14:14,980
我穿着聚酯纤维衣服呢
This is worse than being naked!

304
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:16,640
这比不穿衣服还悲哀
I'm wearing polyester!

305
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:19,640
我在布鲁克林当服务员已经够悲哀了
It's bad enough I'm a waitress in Brooklyn.

306
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:21,620
现在我出现在曼哈顿 却还是服务员
Now I'm a waitress in Manhattan,

307
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:23,920
而这些家伙连小费都不给
and these guys didn't even tip!

308
00:14:24,342 --> 00:14:26,600
别生气嘛 这只是一张照片
No, no, no, it's a photograph,

309
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,200
只是比较象征性意味吧
so it's more symbolic.

310
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:31,320
照片名就叫"服务员"
It's called "Waitress"

311
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,860
我还拿着记单本
and I'm holding a check pad.

312
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:37,000
这些蓝点点是什么意思
What do all these blue dots mean?

313
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,900
我的照片有问题吗
Is my picture in trouble?

314
00:14:40,660 --> 00:14:43,140
这是有多少人次买你的照片的意思
That's how many times your print has been purchased.

315
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,860
这边 麦克斯 我们要远离
Over here, Max, away from that

316
00:14:48,860 --> 00:14:51,240
那个穿着服务员制服的可悲金发女
pathetic blonde lady in the waitress uniform.

317
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:55,280
你别神经兮兮的好吗 根本没人认出你
Will you relax? No one even recognized you.

318
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:58,420
没人吗 刚才那个艺术评论家说
No one? What about that art critic who said that

319
00:14:58,420 --> 00:14:59,440
"照片上我的笑容
"My smile on the photo

320
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:02,300
是对无望无出路的人生仍怀抱
was a study of tragic, foolish optimism

321
00:15:02,300 --> 00:15:04,500
可悲盲目的乐观的绝佳案例"
in a hopeless, dead-end life"?

322
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:08,080
他呀
Oh, him.

323
00:15:08,919 --> 00:15:11,160
"无望无出路的人生"
"Hopeless, dead-end life"?

324
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:13,020
更悲哀的是 没人买我的照片
And then worse, no one buys me?

325
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:14,960
就连作为一个失败者 都不能获得成功
I'm not even a success as a failure?

326
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:19,440
你完全是一个成功的失败者
You're totally a success as a failure.

327
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:21,760
那为什么我没有蓝点点 麦克斯
Then where are all the blue dots, Max?

328
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,220
有15个人买你耶
15 people bought you.

329
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:25,420
不管你要干嘛 千万别转身
Whatever you do, don't turn around.

330
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,660
瞧瞧这些蓝点点
Look at these dots!

331
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:34,800
我要跟这些人回家了
I am going home with all these people--

332
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:37,600
无论男女 无论黑人白人
men, women, black, white.

333
00:15:37,680 --> 00:15:42,260
就像上世纪70年代乔·纳马斯家的换妻游戏那样
It's like a key party at Joe Namath's house in the '70s.

334
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:48,860
搞笑妹
Hey, Shecky!

335
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:51,280
你为什么要把蓝点贴到你朋友照片那里
Why are you putting a dot by your friend's photo?

336
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,700
卖这些照片应该能挣贼多钱吧
Uh, how many extra croutons can you buy

337
00:15:54,700 --> 00:15:57,160
这么多钱你能付得起多少额外面包丁呢
with the buttload of money you're making from these photos?

338
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:58,140
贼多
A buttload.

339
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,860
好好 我懂 你不爽嘛
Okay, Okay. I get it, you're mad.

340
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:01,820
那我告诉你
Tell you what.

341
00:16:01,820 --> 00:16:05,220
我免费送你一张你的照片
I will give you a free print of your photo.

342
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:06,780
听着 我不要照片
Look, keep the photo.

343
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:09,120
我不要我在"联姻"番茄酱的照片
I don't want a picture of me marrying ketchups.

344
00:16:09,900 --> 00:16:11,720
我不要我跟任何人联姻的照片
I don't want a picture of me marrying anybody.

345
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:15,020
但你可以用其他方式补偿我
But you can pay me back another way.

346
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:17,280
我告诉过你 我不是同性恋
I told you, I'm not a lesbian.

347
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:18,220
我只是爱戴帽子而已
I just wear hats.

348
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:24,800
你的朋友说你不喜欢自己的照片
Your friend says you hate your photo.

349
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:25,920
不啊
No.

350
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:28,540
我喜欢被人偷拍
I enjoy being secretly photographed

351
00:16:28,540 --> 00:16:31,820
尤其是在为某人偷加再偷加面包丁时
while I'm stealing someone extra, extra croutons.

352
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,000
我要申明一点
For the record,

353
00:16:33,060 --> 00:16:35,960
我从来不觉得你的笑容很傻
I never saw your smile as foolish.

354
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,200
我觉得...
I saw it as, uh...

355
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:39,280
你笑得有点开
just a little big.

356
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:42,520
我只是想夸夸你啊
Uh--I'm trying to pay you a compliment.

357
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:44,120
不好意思 夸马腿上了
Well, you failed.

358
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:47,500
一直以来 每次你看着我
All this time, when you looked at me,

359
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:49,020
我以为你看到的是我的特别
I thought you saw something special,

360
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:52,260
但你真正看到的只是跟顾客介绍特别菜的人
but all you really saw was someone reading the specials.

361
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:54,380
我有个问题想问你
I have a question for you.

362
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:56,860
好吧 我戴圆顶礼帽
Okay, fine. I wear the derby

363
00:16:56,860 --> 00:16:58,920
是因为我有一点小秃顶
because I have a little bit of a bald spot.

364
00:17:01,460 --> 00:17:02,660
为什么没人买我
Why didn't I sell?

365
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:05,197
照片没拍好
The picture sucks.

366
00:17:05,197 --> 00:17:07,380
我最差的作品之一
One of my worst.

367
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:08,980
如果你还想着要夸夸我
If you're still trying to give me a compliment,

368
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:09,820
那你真得加把劲儿了
you're still failing.

369
00:17:10,540 --> 00:17:14,040
优秀的摄影师能捕捉到真实的瞬间
Look, a good photograph captures the truth.

370
00:17:14,040 --> 00:17:17,280
我猜是因为没有人相信
And I guess no one really believes

371
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:18,660
你是一个服务员
you as a waitress.

372
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:24,160
这是我听过别人夸我最棒的话了
That is the single nicest thing anyone's ever said to me.

373
00:17:24,820 --> 00:17:27,640
那不是你想要成为的人 我懂
So it's not where you wanna be--I get it.

374
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:31,060
我花了50年的时间才成为了今天的自己
Look, it's taken me 50 years to be where I am.

375
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:34,660
你还非常年轻
And you are still so young.

376
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:38,660
这是我听过别人夸我第二棒的话
That is the second-nicest thing anyone's ever said to me!

377
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:42,520
人生路还漫长 相信我
The road is long, and trust me,

378
00:17:42,780 --> 00:17:44,800
这一路你会历尽艰辛
it can be really hard.

379
00:17:45,600 --> 00:17:47,500
所以不管你做什么
So whatever you do,

380
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:51,360
请留住你脸上那充满希望的傻笑
you hold on to that foolishly hopeful smile.

381
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:54,180
还有...你那个搞笑的朋友
And...your funny friend.

382
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:55,860
好吗
Yes?

383
00:17:56,320 --> 00:17:57,040
好的
Yes.

384
00:17:57,980 --> 00:18:01,500
各位 今晚我们一同见证了
Uh, everyone, tonight we are witness

385
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:03,463
诺拉·安德兹
to the amazing work

386
00:18:03,463 --> 00:18:06,293
非凡的作品
of Nola Anderz.

387
00:18:07,180 --> 00:18:10,700
我建议站在这里的所有人 安静片刻
Why don't we all just stand here quietly for a moment

388
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:13,640
让诺拉的大作说明一切
and let Nola's pictures speak.

389
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:20,220
我的手机响了 在哪儿呢
That's my phone. Where is it?

390
00:18:23,180 --> 00:18:25,880
宝贝 为什么我的手机会在你奶罩里
Baby, why is my phone in your bra?

391
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:28,300
别说话
Shh, please!

392
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,660
这是你的秘密手机 我都知道了
It's your secret phone! I know all about it.

393
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,640
你拿走了 快还给我
You took it? Give it to me.

394
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:36,860
她是谁 奥列格 那个下贱的老婊子是谁
Who is she, Oleg? Who is this skanky old whore?

395
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:38,960
保安 保安
Security! Security!

396
00:18:40,260 --> 00:18:42,500
别别别 住手 是她拿了我手机
What--no, no, no! Stop, stop--she has my phone.

397
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:44,460
各位 那是他的手"鸡"
It's his boner phone, everybody!

398
00:18:44,580 --> 00:18:46,080
那是他的手"鸡"
It's his boner phone!

399
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,520
而你居然有"睾"[胆]认为
And you had the testicles to think

400
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:53,620
是我会让你丢脸
I was gonna embarrass you.

401
00:18:58,380 --> 00:18:59,242
苏菲
Hey, Sophie.

402
00:18:59,242 --> 00:19:01,400
姑娘们
Hey, girls.

403
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,260
你们听见了吗
Did you hear that?

404
00:19:02,860 --> 00:19:05,080
这声音有点像...我也不知道
It sounds a little bit like...I don't know.

405
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,300
偷情之声
The sound of cheating.

406
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:10,080
你们俩还没和好吗
You guys haven't made up yet?

407
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:11,420
千万别在这里"合"
Don't make up here.

408
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:13,700
没呢 我昨晚睡在沙发上
No. I slept on the couch.

409
00:19:14,020 --> 00:19:15,400
我超级想她 于是我一边看爱情喜剧
I missed her so much, I watched a romcom

410
00:19:16,060 --> 00:19:18,500
一边吃了一整盒她的可食用内衣
while eating a whole box of her edible underwear.

411
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:21,640
还是不愿意跟我说话吗 苏菲
Still not talking to me, Sophie?

412
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:25,280
我再说最后一次 我真的没有其他女人
For the last time, there's nobody else but you.

413
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:26,940
我用那个手机
I use that phone...

414
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:27,420
干嘛
Yes?

415
00:19:27,900 --> 00:19:28,320
用来...
to...

416
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:29,120
继续说啊
Go on.

417
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:30,400
我用它来打电话给...
I use it to call...

418
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,200
快说重点
Cut to the chase!

419
00:19:32,380 --> 00:19:33,120
我妈
My mother.

420
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:35,840
他真是谁都不放过呀
Is there no one he won't sleep with?

421
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,520
我没告诉你是因为
I didn't tell you because

422
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:40,480
我不想让你觉得我是依恋妈妈的男人
I didn't want you to think I was a mama's boy.

423
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:42,400
除了我们玩"母子游戏"的时候
Except when we play "Mama and Boy."

424
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:45,740
好吧
Well...

425
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:47,780
我要说的话就跟我对
I'll tell you what I told that girl

426
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:49,280
扬基蜡烛店那女孩说的一样
at the Yankee Candle store.

427
00:19:49,740 --> 00:19:51,180
"老娘不买[信]"
"I'm not buyin' it!"

428
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,620
我没骗你 苏菲
It's true, Sophie.

429
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:56,700
我在担心...我的头发会掉光
I'm afraid I'm... losing my hair.

430
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:00,710
奥列格
Oh...Oleg.

431
00:20:02,060 --> 00:20:03,300
可你不知道吗
But don't you know...

432
00:20:03,980 --> 00:20:06,700
就算你的头发
I mean, you could be balder than

433
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:09,604
比15年前杰里米·皮文还少
Jeremy Piven was 15 years ago,

434
00:20:09,604 --> 00:20:12,573
我也依然爱你
and I'd still love ya.

435
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:20,360
我的手机呢
Where's my--

436
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:20,940
被发现了
Busted.

437
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:25,800
卡洛琳 我有东西要给你
Caroline, I have something for you.

438
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:28,060
我才不要又在一张
I'm not signing another one of those

439
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:30,240
巨大的生日卡片上签名
giant birthday cards again.

440
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:36,640
是我的照片
It's my picture.

441
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:39,900
这下可好 我有两个不服务客人的你
Great. Now I have two of you that don't wait on tables.

442
00:20:40,940 --> 00:20:42,880
"谢谢你的面包丁 诺拉"
"Thanks for the croutons. Nola."

443
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:44,980
麦克斯 我们要把我挂在哪里呢
Max, where are we gonna hang me?

444
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,760
或许你应该在厕所里自挂东南枝
Maybe you should hang yourself in the bathroom

445
00:20:46,760 --> 00:20:48,060
就像三年前我以为你会这么做那样
like I thought you would three years ago.

446
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:51,740
是啊 那次打赌害我输了20块
Yep. I lost $20 on that bet.

447
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:53,840
麦克斯
You know, Max,

448
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:56,420
或许我应该不再逃避这部分的人生
maybe I have to stop running away from this part of my life

449
00:20:56,420 --> 00:20:57,580
而是拥抱它
and embrace it,

450
00:20:57,760 --> 00:20:59,060
把它看作我人生的一段旅途
see it as part of my journey,

451
00:20:59,060 --> 00:21:01,420
我美丽又激动人心的旅途
my...beautiful, exciting journey.

452
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:03,660
如果你再不闭嘴 我就在这里把你"挂"了
If you don't shut up, I'm gonna hang you right here.
